== 3. Lemma C4 (random R on 5..7 vertices, random disjoint U, V', several theta) ==
   480 (R, U, V', theta) tests: violations of the inequality 0 (largest LHS - RHS = 0.000e+00); cases with equality 0
   theta = 1/4: right side != 2^(-rank of the U x V' block of beta) or LHS > 2^(-rank beta): 0 failures
